558-de82ec8d308f",536870920]],["^15",[1726,"^3","- Text manipulation tools are utilities or software that enable users to modify, process, and transform text data efficiently.\n- These tools are often used in scripting, data cleaning, and automation tasks.\n- Common text manipulation tools include:\n\t- [[sed]] (stream editor) for search and replace,\n\t- [[awk]] for pattern scanning and data extraction,\n\t- and [[grep]] for searching text using regular expressions.\n- Other popular tools include:\n\t- [[cut]],\n\t- [[sort]],\n\t- [[tr]],\n- and [[uniq]] for various text processing functions.\n- These command-line tools are commonly used in UNIX/Linux environments to handle large text files, automate workflows, and perform complex text transformations.\n- [linux text processing]([Linux Text Processing Command](https://earthly.dev/blog/linux-text-processing-commands/))",536870920]],["^15",[1726,"^17",1746025480525,536870920]],["^15",[1726,"^Z","pages/text manipulation.md",536870920]],["^15",[1727,"^K",1746025480522,536870920]],["^15",[1727,"^@",false,536870920]],["^15",[1727,"^Y","sed",536870920]],["^15",[1727,"^11","sed",536870920]],["^15",[1727,"^B",1746025480522,536870920]],["^15",[1727,"^;","~u68123c08-bf26-4f51-a5a9-02e53f434053",536870920]],["^15",[1728,"^K",1746025480523,536870920]],["^15",[1728,"^@",false,536870920]],["^15",[1728,"^Y","awk",536870920]],["^15",[1728,"^11","awk",536870920]],["^15",[1728,"^B",1746025480523,536870920]],["^15",[1728,"^;","~u68123c08-65a8-4ef7-90c5-43af3090174e",536870920]],["^15",[1729,"^K",1746025480523,536870920]],["^15",[1729,"^@",false,536870920]],["^15",[1729,"^Y","cut",536870920]],["^15",[1729,"^11","cut",536870920]],["^15",[1729,"^B",1746025480523,536870920]],["^15",[1729,"^;","~u68123c08-9192-4c19-b606-9b10c8864616",536870920]],["^15",[1730,"^K",1746025480524,536870920]],["^15",[1730,"^@",false,536870920]],["^15",[1730,"^Y","sort",536870920]],["^15",[1730,"^11","sort",536870920]],["^15",[1730,"^B",1746025480524,536870920]